    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Serotonin syndrome risk rises with other serotonergic drugs (eg, SSRIs, SNRIs, triptans). Aspirin, NSAIDs, other antiplatelets, warfarin and other anticoagulants may add to bleeding risk; with warfarin, monitor coagulation indices when starting, changing or stopping trazodone."
